---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="Learn about Devmove, its mission, and how to participate."><p class="eyebrow">Behind the code</p><h1>A place to build calmly and share the process.</h1><p class="lead">Devmove is an initiative to turn ideas into small, open, and consistent projects.</p><section class="section content-narrow"><h2>What drives us</h2><p>We want to learn in public, document the process, and make it easier for new developers to join. We do not promise revolutions: we prefer to ship useful things, explain how they were made, and improve a little each cycle.</p><h2>How it works</h2><div class="grid"><div class="card"><h3>Clear scope</h3><p>Focused projects with room to start small and grow with the community.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Documentation in Portuguese</h3><p>Decisions and learnings, straight to the point, so more people can follow along.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Open by default</h3><p>Static website, public code, and contributions welcome on GitHub.</p></div></div><div class="actions"><a class="btn" href={`${base}en/projects`}>See projects →</a></div></section></BaseLayout>
